              <ownedOperation xmi:id="_cBtqvGYXEe6uL7xt-YnTxg" name="verifyNoChannelConflicts" visibility="private" isStatic="true" method="_cCu-b2YXEe6uL7xt-YnTxg">
                <ownedComment xmi:id="_rwC1apXmEe6MhezhJ-iEDA">
                  <body>Verifies the absence of channel conflicts in the given WARP interface.
   *
   * @param warp The WARP interface to verify channel conflicts of.</body>
                </ownedComment>
